  "body": "Space for family, privacy to unwind and a home made for entertaining. Set behind security gates on\r\napproximately 1,527m², this substantial five-bedroom St Heliers residence brings together a heated\r\nswimming pool, established gardens and three generous living areas.\r\n\r\nDesigned by Scott Fowler of Architektur, the 423m² limestone brick and cedar home combines\r\ndistinctive design with a practical layout that gives everyone room to spread out. Mature trees and\r\nsweeping lawns create a private setting, with ample parking for visitors and space for a boat.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, the main living areas open to decks for outdoor dining and relaxing. An oak-floored kitchen\r\nand dining area, concealed pantry and barbecue deck with a glimpse of the harbour make hosting\r\neasy . A separate lounge with a marble fireplace provides a welcoming winter retreat.\r\n\r\nThe main bedroom suite includes a walk-in wardrobe, ensuite and adjoining office. A second\r\nbedroom and bathroom on this level offer flexibility for family or guests.\r\n\r\nDownstairs, three further bedrooms and a generous lounge open to the poolside deck and garden. It\r\nis a layout particularly well suited to families with older children or teenagers, offering space to\r\nspend time together and room to enjoy some independence.\r\n\r\nFeatures include:\r\n\r\n• Five bedrooms, three bathrooms and an office\r\n• Three living areas across two levels\r\n• Heated swimming pool, generous decking and lawns\r\n• Triple internal-access garaging\r\n• Gated entry and ample additional parking\r\n• 1,527m² grounds (mol) and a 423m² home (mol)\r\n\r\nWith St Heliers village and beach nearby, this is an opportunity to enjoy space and privacy in one of\r\nAuckland’s sought-after coastal suburbs.\r\n\r\nCome and appreciate the setting, proportions and choice of indoor and outdoor living spaces for\r\nyourself. Contact Paul to arrange a private viewing, or join us at the advertised open home. Please\r\ndrive down; ample parking is available.\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
